{"id":"65600ada133deed1","group":"93","path":"93/93-ax-modus-ponens.md","title":"Modus Ponens","display":"ax-modus-ponens — Modus Ponens","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-ax-modus-ponens","aliases":["93-ax-modus-ponens"],"display":"ax-modus-ponens — Modus Ponens","depends_on":["[[93-df-classical-propositional-calculus]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-ax-modus-ponens"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-ax-modus-ponens</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-modus-ponens — Modus Ponens"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3c8f5c9e577b791\" href=\"?note=e3c8f5c9e577b791\" title=\"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus\">93-df-classical-propositional-calculus</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is the concrete Hilbert presentation of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e3c8f5c9e577b791\" href=\"?note=e3c8f5c9e577b791\" title=\"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus\">93-df-classical-propositional-calculus</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span> have their source signatures.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}modus\\text{-}ponens}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\;\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\;\n\\Bigl((\\Gamma\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\varphi\n\\land\\Gamma\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi))\n\\to\\Gamma\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\psi\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}modus\\text{-}ponens}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\;\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\;\n\\Bigl((\\Gamma\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\varphi\n\\land\\Gamma\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\n\\operatorname{Imp}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}(\\varphi,\\psi))\n\\to\\Gamma\\vdash^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\psi\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The conclusion is scoped to the concrete calculus whose sole rule is the displayed modus-ponens relation; it is not inferred from the bare Tarskian-logic axioms.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"e3c8f5c9e577b791","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-classical-propositional-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"e3c8f5c9e577b791","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)$ is the concrete Hilbert presentation of [[93-df-classical-propositional-calculus]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\